/**
 * @page engineering_navigation Interface Documentation
 * @brief Source responsibilities and interface documentation conventions.
 *
 * @section source_entries Source entries
 * - Class interface: include/distance_controller/distance_controller.hpp
 * - Control implementation: src/distance_controller.cpp
 * - Process entry: src/main.cpp
 * - Package guide: README.md
 * - Flow: docs/flow.md
 * - Tools: docs/tooling.md
 * - Tests: test/README.md
 *
 * @section annotation_convention Documentation convention
 * Classes describe responsibilities, dependencies, and state. Functions describe
 * purpose, parameter directions and provenance, return values, and side effects.
 * Member documentation states units, frames, clock bases, and flag meanings.
 * Source uses Doxygen comments; no duplicate interface description is kept in the implementation.
 */
